gyRWhfM2lCbTd0SmI4ZEJtcklNUGNUbG40ZVFuanJWaFp1aWdIcjFvTEltN2FyZlQ5MGlhcXRia2NUWjFnQUkta2pWYVFJTGpXZ9IBWkFVX3lxTE1CaHFpQ19ON2gyRWhfM2lCbTd0SmI4ZEJtcklNUGNUbG40ZVFuanJWaFp1aWdIcjFvTEltN2FyZlQ5MGlhcXRia2NUWjFnQUkta2pWYVFJTGpXZw?oc=5","date":"2026-11-12","zh":"波士頓科學公司的 Penumbra 交易在歐盟開放徵求意見"},{"title":"Boston Scientific inks $455M deal with global investment firm to work on next-gen heart pump","src":"Cardiovascular Business","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-09","zh":"波士頓科學 (Boston Scientific) 與全球投資公司簽署 4.55 億美元協議，開發下一代心臟泵"},{"title":"Boston Scientific, Blackstone Strike $455M Mini Heart Pump Deal","src":"Medical Product Outsourcing","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNRzI4MHN5MUxzenhBWndna2ZFazdDVExaSUtCdy1DQmpOMDF1bFdZVFhVSzR4cVJJWk9nN3dnWE9aakV3NmlaX085YnF2MHZ4SFdZZnQwWGd6a1pxY2VtMHpIWC1fZ0YtUUJnZVRWVFdtZzBCTk84MHBDLUJtNzdyQ0xyVjQzTmJYN1JzY2ZIOXZ4dE5tSnRYazNyVXpsNUlrN1E?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"波士頓科學 (Boston Scientific) 與黑石 (Blackstone) 達成 4.55 億美元迷你心臟幫浦交易"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":7},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/885725/000088572526000010/bsx-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Boston Scientific Corporation is a global developer, manufacturer and marketer of medical devices that are used in a broad range of interventional medical specialties. Our mission is to transform lives through innovative medical solutions that improve the health of patients around the world. As a medical technology leader for more than 45 years, we have advanced the practice of less-invasive medicine by helping physicians and other medical professionals diagnose and treat a wide range of diseases and medical conditions and improve patients' quality of life by providing alternatives to surgery and other medical procedures that are typically traumatic to the body. We advance science for life by providing a broad range of high-performance solutions to address unmet patient needs and reduce the cost of health care. When used in this report, the terms \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our\" and \"the Company\" mean ","zh":"波士頓科學公司是全球性醫療設備開發商、製造商和行銷商，其產品廣泛應用於介入醫學專業。我們的使命是透過創新的醫療解決方案改變生活，改善世界各地患者的健康。作為超過 45 年的醫療技術領導者，我們透過幫助醫生和其他醫療專業人員診斷和治療各種疾病和醫療狀況，推進微創醫學實踐，並透過提供手術和其他通常對身體造成創傷的醫療程序的替代方案來改善患者的生活品質。我們透過提供廣泛的高效能解決方案來滿足未滿足的患者需求並降低醫療保健成本，從而推動生命科學的發展。本報告中使用的術語「我們」、「我們的」和「本公司」是指"},{"en":"We operate pursuant to five strategic imperatives. We aim to: Strengthen Category Leadership, Expand into High Growth Adjacencies, Drive Global Expansion, Fund the Journey to Fuel Growth and Develop Key Capabilities. We believe that our","zh":"我們依照五項策略要務開展營運。我們的目標是：加強品類領導地位、擴展到高成長週邊地區、推動全球擴張、為推動成長之旅提供資金並發展關鍵能力。我們相信我們的"},{"en":"execution of these strategic imperatives will help us deliver on our mission, drive innovation and increase value for our customers and employees, while strengthening our leadership position in the medical device industry and delivering profitable revenue growth.","zh":"執行這些策略要務將有助於我們實現使命、推動創新並為客戶和員工增加價值，同時加強我們在醫療器材產業的領導地位並實現獲利性收入成長。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We encounter significant competition across our business segments, product lines and markets, from global and local competitors. Our primary competitors include large manufacturers with multiple lines of business and competing products, as well as a wide range of medical device companies that sell a single or limited number of competitive products or participate in only a specific market segment. We also encounter competition from the entry of low-cost manufacturers, which may lead to increased pricing pressure. In certain countries, and particularly in China, we face competition from domestic medical device companies that may benefit from their status as local suppliers. We also face competition from non-medical device companies, which may offer alternative therapies for disease states that could also be treated using our products, or from companies offering technologies that could augm","zh":"我們的業務部門、產品線和市場都面臨來自全球和本地競爭對手的激烈競爭。我們的主要競爭對手包括擁有多種業務和競爭產品的大型製造商，以及銷售單一或有限數量競爭產品或僅參與特定細分市場的各種醫療器材公司。我們也遇到低成本製造商進入的競爭，這可能會導致定價壓力增加。在某些國家，特別是在中國，我們面臨來自國內醫療器材公司的競爭，這些公司可能會受益於其作為本地供應商的地位。我們也面臨來自非醫療器材公司的競爭，這些公司可能為也可以使用我們的產品治療的疾病狀態提供替代療法，或來自提供可以增強治療效果的技術的公司。"},{"en":"We believe that our products and solutions compete primarily on their ability to deliver both differentiated clinical and economic outcomes for our customers by enabling physicians to perform diagnostic and therapeutic procedures safely and effectively often in a less-invasive and cost effective manner. We also compete on ease of use, comparative effectiveness, reliability and physician familiarity. In the current environment of managed care, with economically motivated buyers, consolidation among health care providers, increasing prevalence and importance of regional and national tenders, increased competition and declining reimbursement rates, we are also required to compete on the basis of price, value, reliability and efficiency.","zh":"我們相信，我們的產品和解決方案的競爭主要在於其為客戶提供差異化臨床和經濟成果的能力，使醫生能夠以侵入性較小且具有成本效益的方式安全有效地執行診斷和治療程序。我們也在易用性、相對有效性、可靠性和醫生熟悉度方面競爭。在當前的管理式醫療環境中，買家出於經濟動機，醫療保健提供者之間進行整合，地區和國家招標的普遍性和重要性不斷增加，競爭加劇和報銷率下降，我們還需要在價格、價值、可靠性和效率的基礎上進行競爭。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We encounter significant competition across our business segments, product lines and markets, from global and local competitors. Our primary competitors include large manufacturers with multiple lines of business and competing products, as well as a wide range of medical device companies that sell a single or limited number of competitive products or participate in only a specific market segment. We also encounter competition from the entry of low-cost manufacturers, which may lead to increased pricing pressure. In certain countries, and particularly in China, we face competition from domestic medical device companies that may benefit from their status as local suppliers. We also face competition from non-medical device companies, which may offer alternative therapies for disease states that could also be treated using our products, or from companies offering technologies that could augm","zh":"我們的業務部門、產品線和市場都面臨來自全球和本地競爭對手的激烈競爭。我們的主要競爭對手包括擁有多種業務和競爭產品的大型製造商，以及銷售單一或有限數量競爭產品或僅參與特定細分市場的各種醫療器材公司。我們也遇到低成本製造商進入的競爭，這可能會導致定價壓力增加。在某些國家，特別是在中國，我們面臨來自國內醫療器材公司的競爭，這些公司可能會受益於其作為本地供應商的地位。我們也面臨來自非醫療器材公司的競爭，這些公司可能為也可以使用我們的產品治療的疾病狀態提供替代療法，或來自提供可以增強治療效果的技術的公司。"},{"en":"We believe that our products and solutions compete primarily on their ability to deliver both differentiated clinical and economic outcomes for our customers by enabling physicians to perform diagnostic and therapeutic procedures safely and effectively often in a less-invasive and cost effective manner. We also compete on ease of use, comparative effectiveness, reliability and physician familiarity. In the current environment of managed care, with economically motivated buyers, consolidation among health care providers, increasing prevalence and importance of regional and national tenders, increased competition and declining reimbursement rates, we are also required to compete on the basis of price, value, reliability and efficiency.","zh":"我們相信，我們的產品和解決方案的競爭主要在於其為客戶提供差異化臨床和經濟成果的能力，使醫生能夠以侵入性較小且具有成本效益的方式安全有效地執行診斷和治療程序。我們也在易用性、相對有效性、可靠性和醫生熟悉度方面競爭。在當前的管理式醫療環境中，買家出於經濟動機，醫療保健提供者之間進行整合，地區和國家招標的普遍性和重要性不斷增加，競爭加劇和報銷率下降，我們還需要在價格、價值、可靠性和效率的基礎上進行競爭。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Cardiovascular","val":13250000000,"zh":"心血管"},{"name":"Medsurg","val":6824000000,"zh":"醫學外科"}],"total":20074000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Interventional Cardiology Vascular Therapies","val":4639000000,"zh":"介入性心臟病血管治療"},{"name":"Electrophysiology EP","val":3325000000,"zh":"電生理學EP"},{"name":"Global Endoscopy Endo Reporting Unit","val":2916000000,"zh":"全球內視鏡內視鏡報告單位"},{"name":"Global Urologyand Pelvic Health Reporting Unit","val":2709000000,"zh":"全球泌尿外科和骨盆腔健康報告組"},{"name":"Cardiac Rhythm Management","val":2332000000,"zh":"心律管理"},{"name":"Watchman","val":1958000000,"zh":"守望者"},{"name":"Global Neuromodulation Nm Reporting Unit","val":1199000000,"zh":"全球神經調節 Nm 報告單位"},{"name":"Interventional Oncology Embolization","val":996000000,"zh":"介入性腫瘤栓塞治療"}],"total":20074000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":12864000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":7210000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"EMEA","val":3451000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":3080000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Emerging Markets","val":2985000000,"zh":"新興市場"},{"name":"Latin Americaand Canada","val":678000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲和加拿大"}],"total":20074000000}},"peers":["MDT","SYK","BAX","EW","BDX"]}}